{"data": [{"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-09-11T04:47:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2098272115312959917"], "id": "2098272115312959917", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1550583309708808193", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 32039, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2098244265381925171", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "更多技巧看这里 https://t.co/QiUYBSjKOZ", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2098272115312959917"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-09-11T02:56:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2098244265381925171"], "id": "2098244265381925171", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 274, "impression_count": 119997, "like_count": 480, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 50, "retweet_count": 24}, "text": "一个口交小技巧\n口阴茎时，嘴只包住龟头部分，舌头绕龟头外沿画一圈，再从系带位置勾起舌尖，来到尿道口，用舌尖小力顶一下那个小口\n\n重复上面，同时手握住阴茎体上下撸动，一能提供快感刺激，二能有效防止阴茎进入太多呛到\n\n更刺激一点：把嘴里空气排掉，抽吸状态，别太大力吸\n\nps.注意牙别嗑到", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2098244265381925171"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-09-08T15:04:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2097340218214936777"], "id": "2097340218214936777", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 22, "impression_count": 68629, "like_count": 107, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 91, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "很多小众癖好，我觉得与其压着藏着，让它们扭曲变异，不如摊开来好好观察一下，带着觉察认真的聊一聊\n\n很多癖好背后的原因，并不只是为了快感刺激，也可能是爱、控制、安全的缺失\n\n如果能有健康引导正常表达&amp;谈论的机会，那么它们也未必是洪水猛兽", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2097340218214936777"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-09-05T14:32:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2096237242373058794", "2096245075822981165"], "id": "2096245075822981165", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 27, "impression_count": 51977, "like_count": 29, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 58, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "答疑🌟总是滑出来？\n这个问题男生女生都有问过，不是直接归因到尺寸硬度不够，更主要是五个点\n\n1. 阴道的变形\n2.勃起的角度\n3.润滑问题\n4.动作和姿势\n https://t.co/pb6X0dvWP3", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2096245075822981165"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-09-02T06:35:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2095037970134806671"], "id": "2095037970134806671", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1550583309708808193", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10798, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2092440102416888237", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "最后 24 小时🔥🥰\n\n希望不要再出现那种 结束之后 \n过两天来找我开永久会员的情况了😂", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2095037970134806671"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-09-02T06:34:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2095037589430456470"], "id": "2095037589430456470", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1550583309708808193", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 29819, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2095032398220038232", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "补充\n什么是性欲不匹配，最简单的理解⬇️\n你想一周做一次，ta 想一周做三次\n\n你看到色色的东西立刻有反应，但 ta却觉得没意思没反应\n\n不匹配，是一个状态的中性描述，不是说你们任何一方有问题 or 关系有问题\n\n它就是一种存在于人与人之间的区别", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2095037589430456470"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-09-02T06:13:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2095032398220038232"], "id": "2095032398220038232", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 116, "impression_count": 89010, "like_count": 165, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 38, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "性欲不匹配🌟怎么办？\n在一段长期关系中，两个人的性需求、性欲不匹配，最容易导致性爱出问题，关系矛盾\n\n针对这个问题，最有效的解决办法不是「把自己变得更有性张力、性吸引力」，也不是「学会怎么勾引ta」\n\n而是先理解彼此的欲望来源，运作方式\nhttps://t.co/P3qef5v0JB", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2095032398220038232"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-08-31T13:23:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2094415784810336758"], "id": "2094415784810336758", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1550583309708808193", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 8599, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2092440102416888237", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "最后三天🔥🔥🔥", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2094415784810336758"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-08-27T02:06:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2092795826498048221"], "id": "2092795826498048221", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 72, "impression_count": 96945, "like_count": 194, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 104, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "女生自慰🌟快感发力\n发力夹紧屁股/大腿，绷紧腰腹，会因为肌肉收缩带来一些更强的快感\n\n但是发力 or 不发力都正常，这是个人选择\n\n也是身体的自然反应，比如健身时如果这部分肌肉也在用力，也会体验到一样的快感\n\n咱们自慰可以不依赖某个单一路径\n而是尽可能多的掌握不同方式\n从而让快感来源变多", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2092795826498048221"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-08-24T12:42:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2091868687351296041"], "id": "2091868687351296041", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 120, "impression_count": 119312, "like_count": 438, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 106, "retweet_count": 34}, "text": "𝐒𝐞𝐱和𝐋𝐨𝐯𝐞究竟能不能分开\n这个问题一直有争议，客观上，从神经科学角度说，是分的不太明显\n\n主观上，我觉得会随着人的经历而变化，看你自己在当下人生阶段的需求，以及对自身需求的理解是怎样的\n\n比如我 20", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2091868687351296041"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-08-22T14:36:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2091172634838839454"], "id": "2091172634838839454", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1550583309708808193", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 39401, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2091171761031205004", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "提到的女生自慰课和相关内容\n课程🔗 https://t.co/ktitJUKQFA\n\n自慰精讲🔗 https://t.co/z249LekOGS", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2091172634838839454"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-08-22T14:32:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2091162982428319955", "2091171761031205004"], "id": "2091171761031205004", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 47, "impression_count": 64243, "like_count": 45, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "直播答疑·女生自慰🌟\n需要特定的方式/姿势/工具，才能高潮，如何解决？\n\n在这些方式/姿势/工具都对的时候，甚至可以快速高潮🥂但只要这些条件不在，就完全无法高潮、甚至没感觉\n\n🌟这种情况要怎么办？\n🌟正常吗？\n🌟能改善吗？\n\n https://t.co/gwjYJ9CRjF", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2091171761031205004"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-08-19T03:19:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2089915239886143941"], "id": "2089915239886143941", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 811, "impression_count": 426097, "like_count": 917, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 145, "retweet_count": 68}, "text": "新手教学👉🏼第一次性爱\n\n第一次的目标，是熟悉彼此身体、敏感区，确保大家脱光了之后面对面能放松自在，不尴尬，有探索欲\n\n新手期对任何人来说，都是一次预期/幻想和现实的碰撞，所以多少会有落差感，这是正常的，对有一些人来说，是需要多次以上的性体验才能适应的\n\nhttps://t.co/jsIOV9hRkQ", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2089915239886143941"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-08-17T20:30:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2089449863473672297"], "id": "2089449863473672297", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 19, "impression_count": 60914, "like_count": 31, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 65, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "直播答个疑·女生向⬇️\n最近大家的主要问题是：我需要特定的方式/姿势/工具，才能高潮\n\n在这些方式/姿势/工具都对的时候，甚至可以快速高潮🥂但只要这些条件不在，就完全无法高潮、甚至没感觉\n\n🌟这种情况要怎么办？\n🌟正常吗？\n🌟能改善吗？\n\n https://t.co/gwjYJ9CRjF", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2089449863473672297"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-08-17T05:10:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2089218321174384855"], "id": "2089218321174384855", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 27, "impression_count": 71344, "like_count": 69, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 60, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2089010530581127266", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "补充：\n阴蒂是由勃起组织构成的，没有腺体——它在兴奋时的反应是充血、肿胀（不是出水）\n\n有时候摸起来滑滑的，是因为其他地方的润滑被带过去了\n\n表面覆盖的阴蒂包皮属于皮肤，含皮脂腺，分泌的是皮脂，不是润滑液 https://t.co/bU6Y3obSXb", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2089218321174384855"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-08-16T15:24:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2089010530581127266"], "id": "2089010530581127266", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 16, "impression_count": 136461, "like_count": 97, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 128, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "阴蒂本身不分泌润滑\n所以需要用手指蘸取一点润滑液，再触碰，会减少摩擦带来的不适感", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2089010530581127266"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-08-16T15:21:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2089009596920680738"], "id": "2089009596920680738", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1550583309708808193", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 18, "impression_count": 38473, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2088617487482933464", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "更详细全面的阴蒂知识、自慰技巧、快感提升，可以看这个⬇️\nhttps://t.co/ktitJUKQFA", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2089009596920680738"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-08-16T15:19:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2089009114198270367"], "id": "2089009114198270367", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 93, "impression_count": 78129, "like_count": 187, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 29, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "给女生找阴蒂⬇️\n很多人其实找不到对方阴蒂，会直接在大概位置胡乱摸\n\n虽说有概率找到，更多会摸错、无法控制力道弄痛阴蒂\n\n【正确做法】\n从女生肚脐中间，向下划直线到阴唇交汇的上方，轻柔按压抚摸，直到感知到凸起的阴蒂\n\n不要掰开阴蒂外包皮，先隔着揉，轻微变化速度和压力，找到女生最舒服的状态", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2089009114198270367"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-08-15T15:44:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2088653064852869158"], "id": "2088653064852869158", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1550583309708808193", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 13255, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "1917413990688227684", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "最新的课程链接（原来那个挂了）\nhttps://t.co/aPCMr3eM5G", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2088653064852869158"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-08-15T13:23:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2088617487482933464"], "id": "2088617487482933464", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 217, "impression_count": 449454, "like_count": 798, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 346, "retweet_count": 14}, "text": "找自己的阴蒂⬇️\n两腿中间放个镜子、打个灯，阴唇上方交汇处，轻轻触摸+适当按压\n\n如果毛毛太长太浓密有遮挡，需要适当清理一下or扒开\n\n因为有宝说找不到\n可以试试上面的办法", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2088617487482933464"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-08-07T13:12:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2085712744834007380", "2085715783305322803", "2085715829342061004"], "id": "2085715829342061004", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 54, "impression_count": 125731, "like_count": 173, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 91, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "有宝子提问🤔吵架𝐬𝐞𝐱，\n让我想起一个很久前的经历，和当时的男朋友刚搬到一起时，两人因为睡床的哪边吵到歇斯底里，我哭他把我推倒在床扒裤子，在满是纸箱的卧室里疯狂交缠，又闹又疯，我抓咬，他压住，那个瞬间只有某种快感加上愤怒，混乱又不堪\n后来谁也没再提，各自找了一边\n\n但现在——", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2085715829342061004"}], "errors": [{"detail": "Could not find tweet with referenced_tweets.id: [2092440102416888237].", "parameter": "referenced_tweets.id", "resource_id": "2092440102416888237", "resource_type": "tweet", "title": "Not Found Error", "type": "https://api.x.com/2/problems/resource-not-found", "value": "2092440102416888237"}, {"detail": "Could not find tweet with referenced_tweets.id: [2092440102416888237].", "parameter": "referenced_tweets.id", "resource_id": "2092440102416888237", "resource_type": "tweet", "title": "Not Found Error", "type": "https://api.x.com/2/problems/resource-not-found", "value": "2092440102416888237"}], "includes": {"tweets": [{"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-09-11T02:56:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2098244265381925171"], "id": "2098244265381925171", "pu